---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '@components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title='Privacy Policy | FUYAO IMAGE' description='How FUYAO IMAGE (photos.iforworlds.com) handles privacy: local browser processing, anonymous analytics, and advertising.'>
    <Header />
    <article
        class='prose prose-zinc mx-auto container py-12 dark:prose-invert'
    >
        <div class='space-y-2 not-prose'>
            <h1
                class='text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight lg:text-5xl lg:leading-[3.5rem]'
            >
                Privacy Policy
            </h1>
            <p class='text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400'>
                Effective October 2, 2026 · FUYAO IMAGE (photos.iforworlds.com)
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class='mt-6'>
            <p>
                This privacy policy applies to FUYAO IMAGE
                (photos.iforworlds.com), operated by FUYAO STUDIO ("we", "us").
                We take user privacy very seriously.
            </p>
            <h2>Local Processing</h2>
            <p>
                All image tools on this website run entirely in your browser.
                Your photos are processed locally on your device and are
                <strong>never uploaded to our servers</strong>. We cannot see,
                store or access the images you edit.
            </p>
            <h2>Data Collection</h2>
            <p>
                This website only uses <a href='https://vercel.com/'>Vercel Analytics</a>
                for simple anonymous analytics and does not collect any
                personally identifiable information.
            </p>
            <p>
                Vercel Analytics is a privacy-friendly web analytics tool that
                complies with GDPR, CCPA, PECR and other data privacy
                regulations. It does not use cookies or any 3rd party tracking
                scripts and cannot uniquely identify individual users.
            </p>
            <p>Information collected by Vercel Analytics includes:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your IP address (displayed anonymized)</li>
                <li>Date and time of visit</li>
                <li>Pages visited</li>
                <li>Browser and operating system info</li>
                <li>Referring website</li>
            </ul>
            <h2>Advertising</h2>
            <p>
                Ads on this website are served by the third-party ad network
                Adsterra, loaded via a service worker. Adsterra and its
                advertisers use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to
                this and other websites. You can clear your browser data
                (including the service worker registration) to stop
                personalized ads.
            </p>
            <h2>Use of Data</h2>
            <p>
                The analytics data collected is only used to improve this
                website and not for any commercial purpose.
            </p>
            <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
            <p>
                No data collected by this website is shared with any 3rd
                parties, except as described in the Advertising section above.
            </p>
            <h2>Data Retention</h2>
            <p>
                Visit logs in Vercel Analytics are anonymized and deleted
                automatically after 90 days.
            </p>
            <h2>Your Rights</h2>
            <p>
                You have the right to access, rectify or erase any personal
                data stored by this website. You can also contact the website
                administrator to opt out of website analytics.
            </p>
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>
                For any privacy questions, contact us at
                <a href='mailto:cynric1st@epiclll.eu.org'>cynric1st@epiclll.eu.org</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
                This privacy policy may be updated from time to time and it is
                advised to check back periodically.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!--AFTER-CONTENT-->
    </article>
    <Footer />
</Layout>
